00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:58.190
We get all of those together.

00:07:58.190 --> 00:07:59.564
It's not just about monitoring.

00:07:59.564 --> 00:08:00.730
It's not just about metrics.

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:05.080
It's actually logs, metrics,
events, snapshots from debugs,

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:05.980
