00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:08.770
And we get all those signals
together into our backends.

00:08:08.770 --> 00:08:10.090
Our backends [? have ?] stores.

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:11.740
And we have, though-- this
is the-- this part that I

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:13.330
