00:15:52.230 --> 00:15:55.270
You get your Kubernetes
observability.

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:57.090
But it works even
better when you use it

00:15:57.090 --> 00:15:58.860
with the rest of the
Stackdriver tools.

00:15:58.860 --> 00:16:02.400
And hopefully at the end we'll
