00:16:02.400 --> 00:16:05.400
The idea, again, by using
all these tools and signals

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:10.230
together is that we try to give
you a means to speed your root

00:16:10.230 --> 00:16:11.152
cause analysis.

00:16:11.152 --> 00:16:12.610
You'll see in a
couple of the demos

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:14.880
here that we're trying
to focus your attention

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:17.670
into the information that
matters the most to you so

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:19.580
that you follow the
trail that we believe

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:24.030
is the one most likely to give
you the root cause for things.

