00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:25.000
restart [INAUDIBLE]
and whatever is there

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:27.200
are collecting by the Heapster.

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:30.190
And we offer a sector--

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:33.210
we have a monitoring API, which
is public on the internet.

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:37.540
So Heapster is sending this
metric into our monitoring API,

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:39.560
and that is how we
collect system metric

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:41.200
for your Kubernetes application.

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:43.370
At the same time,
we have the sector

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:46.250
of Prometheus collector,
which is a [INAUDIBLE] running

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:48.110
in your port.

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:52.570
And it collects-- scrape all
the Prometheus metrics that's

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:55.100
available there for
your config, and also

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:57.360
right into our monitoring API.

00:17:57.360 --> 00:17:58.880
So this is the
[? path ?] for how

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:01.010
metrics fall into Stackdriver.

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:03.500
In the same time, we
have the two daemon sets.

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:05.840
One is the Stackdriver
metadata agent.

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:09.110
It collects all the matter that
are likely in Kubernetes label,

00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:11.660
your hierarchy in
your Kubernetes,

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:14.660
and what all the
configure is specified,

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:17.570
and then sending it to the
resource matter to the API.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:20.960
And the logging agent is
also another daemon set.

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:24.110
It collects all your standard
outs, standard error, all

00:18:24.110 --> 00:18:24.890
your--

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:26.420
other logs you care about--

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:30.400
and then sending it to our
logging API, which is backend

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:32.000
is our logging storage.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:34.490
This is the architecture
of these offerings.

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:37.010
So we want to explore
a little bit more

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:41.150
