00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:53.240
So there's official
Prometheus collector,

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:57.500
scraping the Prometheus parts
and then sending that data

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.420
and graphing in Grafana.

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:03.590
On Stackdriver, we
