00:25:51.950 --> 00:25:54.110
try to [? surface ?]
information that is

00:25:54.110 --> 00:25:57.870
key to give you a sense of
the health of your cluster.

00:25:57.870 --> 00:25:59.420
So we have [? part ?] readiness.

00:25:59.420 --> 00:26:02.490
We have incidents that may have
