in your infrastructure

00:26:28.720 --> 00:26:32.170
and take a look at your nodes
and the health of your nodes

00:26:32.170 --> 00:26:34.910
and how performant
they are and so on.

00:26:34.910 --> 00:26:36.037
So we can do that.

00:26:36.037 --> 00:26:37.870
If you're a developer,
then you may actually

00:26:37.870 --> 00:26:40.510
want to look at your
deployments or your services

00:26:40.510 --> 00:26:42.760
