00:26:58.390 --> 00:27:00.889
Now because we scaled up-- and
Shoucong was going to show us

00:27:00.889 --> 00:27:02.070
that in a minute--

00:27:02.070 --> 00:27:03.360
something is going on.

00:27:03.360 --> 00:27:05.280
You immediately see
