00:28:06.450 --> 00:28:09.150
Now, one last thing that
I wanted to show you

00:28:09.150 --> 00:28:11.902
was that you can use
all the other features

00:28:11.902 --> 00:28:13.110
that you have in Stackdriver.

00:28:13.110 --> 00:28:15.720
But particularly, when you're
trying to resolve incidents,

00:28:15.720 --> 00:28:18.780
very likely you want to
explore things on demand.

00:28:18.780 --> 00:28:21.330
We mentioned before, we have
an integration with Prometheus.

00:28:21.330 --> 00:28:24.180
So all this Prometheus metrics
have been already ingested

00:28:24.180 --> 00:28:25.170
